rting identifies this as the **government divisional veterinary hospital in Motinagar**. ([indiacustomercare.com](https://www.indiacustomercare.com/directorate-animal-husbandry-and-dairying-mp-no-0755-277-2262?utm_source=openai))\n\n**Government Animal Husbandry Department, Sagar (published office contact):**  \n**07582-223561** — Deputy Director, Animal Husbandry, Sagar. The official district page lists this number; ask for the current veterinary hospital clinician/OPD and whether they can receive an injured community dog. ([sagar.nic.in](https://sagar.nic.in/en/animal-husbandry/?utm_source=openai))\n\nI could not verify a dedicated clinical-reception phone number or current admission hours for the hospital.", "type": "output_text", "logprobs": []}], "role": "assistant", "status": "completed", "type": "message", "phase": "final_answer"}]}}
